<h1>🔐 Argon2id.PasswordHasher demo</h1>

<p class="lede">
    A minimal, runnable demonstration of the <code>Argon2id.PasswordHasher</code>
    library. Walk through user registration and login while seeing exactly what
    the library stores on your behalf.
</p>

<div class="callout callout-info">
    <strong>This is a demo, not a starter template.</strong> Users live in
    process memory and disappear on restart. Hash internals are shown on
    screen so you can <em>see</em> what's happening &#8212; a real application
    would never display these values.
</div>

<h2>Try it</h2>

<ol class="steps">
    <li>
        <a href="register" class="step-link">
            <span class="step-number">1</span>
            <span>
                <strong>Register</strong> a new account.
                The library hashes the password with the default secure parameters
